#@HostAddress = https://localhost:7062
@HostAddress = https://amainix-001-site1.ltempurl.com

### =====================================================================
### 1. PLATFORM LEVEL SCENARIOS (SuperAdmin)
### =====================================================================

### 1.1. Successful Platform SuperAdmin Login (Arabic Language Header)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "email": "admin@amanix.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### 1.2. Successful Platform SuperAdmin Login (English Language Header)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "email": "admin@amanix.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}


### =====================================================================
### 2. TENANT LEVEL SCENARIOS (Tenant Manager / Demo Company)
### =====================================================================

### 2.1. Successful Tenant Manager Login with Subdomain Header (X-Tenant-Domain)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
X-Tenant-Domain: demo

{
  "email": "admin@demo.com",
  "password": "User@123456"
}


### =====================================================================
### 3. ERROR & VALIDATION FAILURE SCENARIOS
### =====================================================================

### 3.1. Invalid Password (Expect 400 Bad Request / Failure Response)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "email": "admin@amanix.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

### 3.2. Validation Failure - Empty Fields (Expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 3.3. Validation Failure - Short Password (Expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "email": "test@amanix.com",
  "password": "123"
}
